    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this aircraft maintenance report.\n\nAircraft ID: {{ $json.body.aircraft_id }}\nComponent: {{ $json.body.component }}\nReport Date: {{ $json.body.report_date }}\nObservation: {{ $json.body.observation }}\nTechnician: {{ $json.body.technician }}\nLocation: {{ $json.body.location }}\n\nDetermine:\n1. Whether the observation indicates a potential issue.\n2. The severity: LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH.\n3. A short explanation.\n4. The recommended next action.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nReturn the severity on the first line exactly in this format:\nSEVERITY: LOW\nor\nSEVERITY: MEDIUM\nor\nSEVERITY: HIGH\n\nThen provide the explanation and recommended action.",
        "options": {}
      },
